# 🐍 Snake Game Pro (Python + Pygame)

## 📌 Description

An advanced Snake Game built using Python and Pygame featuring AI auto-play, sound effects, and interactive UI.

## 🚀 Features

* 🎮 Manual + AI gameplay (Press A to toggle AI)
* ⏸ Pause / Resume (P key)
* 🔁 Restart (R key)
* 🧠 Smart AI movement
* 🔊 Sound effects
* 🏆 High score tracking
* ⚡ Dynamic speed increase
* 🖥 Large responsive UI

## 🎮 Controls

| Key        | Action    |
| ---------- | --------- |
| Arrow Keys | Move      |
| A          | Toggle AI |
| P          | Pause     |
| R          | Restart   |
| M          | Menu      |

## 🛠 Technologies Used

* Python
* Pygame

## ▶ How to Run

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
python snake_game.py
```

